	(text "EN = U1 pin 3 (R3 10k + C8 1µF = power-on reset delay).\nIO0 = U1 pin 27, strapping pin: BOOT button only.\nVA_BTN = U1 pin 31 (GPIO38). Not GPIO0: holding a GPIO0 button\nat power-on enters flash mode."
